Suggests: renoise
Description: 3Dconnexion SpaceNavigator to MIDI CC bridge
 QSpaceMIDI maps the six axes and the two buttons of a 3Dconnexion
 SpaceNavigator 3D mouse to MIDI control change messages, turning it into a
 six dimensional controller for Renoise or any other MIDI host.
 .
 Each degree of freedom has its own CC number, value mode - absolute or one of
 three relative encodings - and sensitivity.  A dead zone filters the resting
 jitter of the cap, and an axis lock transmits only the axis that is deflected
 the most, so that parameters do not bleed into each other while MIDI mapping.
 .
 The device is read directly through evdev, so no proprietary 3DxWare driver is
 needed.  A virtual ALSA sequencer port called QSpaceMIDI is published for the
 host to connect to.
